[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Proton Mail / VPN / Pass (Unwoke)
GenericName=Proton
Comment=No store. Opens Unwoke Proton setup: Trivalent first, hashed official RPM only if you insist.
Exec=/usr/libexec/unwoke/first-session.sh --force --proton
